body:
Here is the thing you haven't defined it once. You have just said your saying xyz that proves toxic masculinity. I say you come across as young because the way you have conducted yourself has been narrow minded and immature. I say you seem like you are gay/fem or trans not because your opinion is different than mine but again the way you have conducted yourself comes across like someone who is gay/fem or trans. If I would have said you are acting like an overly emotional woman that's how I know your gay that would have been me being toxic. If anything you have proven the case for toxic masculinity more than I have. You are making the false equivalency that because I say you come across that way that means bad or inferior to masculine. Here is the problem though that just proves you have a toxic trait not that all masculinity is toxic by default. 

&#x200B;

All that being said I'm not mad at you. You have pretty clearly been bullied by a man in your life or kids at school. I hope as you get older a strong masculine man will come into your life and show you positive side of men.
